{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"royce-pierreson","name":"Royce Pierreson","birthDate":"1989-04-01","birthPlace":"","bio":"Royce Pierreson Banemeck (born 1 April 1989), better known by his stage name Royce Pierreson, is a British actor and narrator. Royce is best known for his roles as DC Jamie Desford in the fourth series of Line of Duty and as Reece in Murdered by My Boyfriend.\n\nHe has since appeared as Dr Jamie Cole in Our Girl (2016), Jason Hales in Wanderlust (2018), Burt Rhodes in Judy (2019), Istredd in The Witcher (2019–present), and Doctor John Watson in The Irregulars (2021).\n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Royce Pierreson, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia.","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-19T17:36:58+00:00","tmdbId":1266313,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/1266313","credits":[{"id":"thor-dark","title":"Thor: The Dark World","character":"Student"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/royce-pierreson.webp","filmography":[{"name":"Nightclub Predator","year":2025,"character":"Self - (Narrator)","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/lG509xGj12eyHSOL2XhMyQ8UKox.jpg"},{"name":"On The Line","year":2023,"character":"Harold","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/1m5AmzHMWRE900JjNO5pKDJcvyO.jpg"},{"name":"The Lazarus Project","year":2022,"character":"Bryson","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xw7GkWtmPQDU8qzfKshFEN038sj.jpg"},{"name":"The Sandman","year":2022,"character":"King Auberon","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/q54qEgagGOYCq5D1903eBVMNkbo.jpg"},{"name":"The Irregulars","year":2021,"character":"Dr. Watson","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/qN6HCKR3ZRqbpGBWFctVlSTKR2k.jpg"},{"name":"Making The Witcher","year":2020,"character":"Self - Istredd","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/zYnwBAUPQn5WmurROH1ravCC6Wp.jpg"},{"name":"Judy","year":2019,"character":"B